    "## Conclusion\n",
    "\n",
    "In this project we demonstrated how a Sudoku puzzle can be formulated as a constraint satisfaction problem.\n",
    "We also implemented a backtarcking algorithm in Python to solve the puzzle and included measuring time required to solve the puzzle.\n",
    "\n",
    "The results show that the algorithm succesfully solves the provided Sudoku board examples.\n","However, the implementationhas been tested only a limited set of input boards, and therfore it cannot be concluded that it works with other types of boards.
